Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.11,0:00:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,举起手来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hands where I can see 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.07,0:00:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是罗伊吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that you, Roy?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.96,0:00:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你就是沃尔特了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which makes you Walt.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.44,0:00:08.93,Note,0,0,0,0,,（忆往昔）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.93,0:00:10.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔迪·米尔斯是个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jody Mills is good people,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.39,0:00:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会给你个住的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she'll give you a place to crash.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.80,0:00:12.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你慢慢缓过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}until you get back on your feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.86,0:00:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你能像我希望的那么无情\N{\fnArial\fs30}If only you'd been as ruthless as I hoped.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.54,0:00:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在怎么办 - 我们开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now what? ‭- Let's begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.08,0:00:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝维尔夫人真是厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do have to hand it to Lady Bevell.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.61,0:00:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的治疗非常成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your treatment's been most successful.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.45,0:00:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.26,0:00:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was talking to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.66,0:00:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}‭Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.17,0:00:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好别动 她会开枪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really wouldn't move. She will shoot you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.36,0:00:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是想去哪 - 凯奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where do you think you're going? - Ketch.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.73,0:00:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的地堡真是绝佳的堡垒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your bunker is an excellent fortress.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.41,0:00:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是更好的坟墓\N{\fnArial\fs30}An even better tomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.85,0:00:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们对锁做了改造 切断了水\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've rejiggered the locks, we've shut off the water,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.70,0:00:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我们走后\N{\fnArial\fs30}and once we leave,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.96,0:00:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,抽入空气的泵会逆转\N{\fnArial\fs30}the pumps that bring in the air shall reverse.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.56,0:00:51.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的氧气会在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your oxygen should be gone in…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.07,0:00:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,两到三天内耗尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}two days, maybe three.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.48,0:00:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come along, Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.52,0:00:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.76,0:01:03.75,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.79,0:01:50.33,Note,0,0,0,0,,（发送至凯奇 莱斯特死了 接下来谁）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.33,0:01:53.39,Note,0,0,0,0,,（汽修厂）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.26,0:02:06.27,Note,0,0,0,0,,（爱达荷州 弗莱德·麦克雷 怀俄明州 科比·谢菲尔德 南达科他州 乔迪·米尔斯）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.70,0:02:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第12季第22集]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.06,0:02:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 车库呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. The garage?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.97,0:02:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,门上有符文 墙里有钢筋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doors are warded and the walls are reinforced steel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.85,0:02:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 或许可以从排气口出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Um, you know, maybe we could get out through the air vents.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.03,0:02:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,爬不了多远\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't get far.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.20,0:02:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,管道系统里有瓶颈\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are choke points in the duct system.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.70,0:02:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都挤不过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}not even I could squeeze through.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.61,0:02:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们杀了她吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say we kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.64,0:02:33.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到凯奇的话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you heard Ketch.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.71,0:02:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只剩三天的空气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Said we had about three days of air left.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.32,0:02:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们杀了她 还能多活一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if we ice her, maybe that buys us an extra day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.12,0:02:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向你保证 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I assure you, Dean,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.33,0:02:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这人呼吸特别浅\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm an extraordinarily shallow breather.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.05,0:02:44.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 - 如果我们能出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right. - If we ever get out of here,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.63,0:02:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我给你们妈妈洗了脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am the one who programmed your mother,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.65,0:02:49.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以也只有我能解除她的洗脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}which means that I am the only one who can undo it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.82,0:02:52.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,鉴于我猜你们会希望妈妈回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And since I assume you want Mummy back,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.98,0:02:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们需要我\N{\fnArial\fs30}you need me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.03,0:02:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你相信她吗 - 不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You believe her? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.50,0:03:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果她是撒谎 好 我们干掉她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, if she's lying, sure, we take her out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.36,0:03:02.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,但妈妈还在外面 被洗脑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Mom is still out there, brainwashed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.77,0:03:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果她说的是实话 我们就需要她\N{\fnArial\fs30}If she's telling the truth, then we do need her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.62,0:03:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你这么聪明 你说我们怎么出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, you're so smart, how do we get out of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.28,0:03:11.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一的出路是拉动手动超控\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only way out is to pull the manual override.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.37,0:03:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有那么个玩意吗 - 有的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is that a thing? - Oh, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.66,0:03:16.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,但在地堡外面 我们够不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's outside the bunker, where we can't reach it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.41,0:03:17.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.27,0:03:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.62,0:03:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在一个大密室里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in a giant vault.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.72,0:03:25.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里满是神秘学书和传说\N{\fnArial\fs30}loaded down with … with occult books and lore.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.34,0:03:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里肯定哪里有点什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's gotta be something somewhere in here …
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.11,0:03:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,一件东西 或一个咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}an item or a spell …
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.45,0:03:30.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么玩意能解除封锁\N{\fnArial\fs30}some hoodoo that can reverse the lockdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.64,0:03:34.56,Note,0,0,0,0,,（第一天）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.70,0:03:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可能有发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I got something.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.86,0:03:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗姆人在欧洲被迫同化时\N{\fnArial\fs30}"When the Romani people were forced to assimilate in Europe,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.15,0:03:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗姆人使用了一种咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The, uh, the Roma used a spell,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.09,0:03:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,废止仪式\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The Abrogation ritual,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.24,0:03:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为对迫害者的反叛\N{\fnArial\fs30}as an act of rebellion against their persecutors.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.55,0:03:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗姆教神能逆转复杂的机械过程\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The Devla turns back complex mechanical processes,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.69,0:03:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,重置设备 机械\N{\fnArial\fs30}resets equipment, machinery."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.17,0:03:56.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 需要什么 - 看来原料很普通\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's it take? - Seems like pretty basic ingredients.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.49,0:03:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是我们有的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing we don't already have.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.43,0:04:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}‭What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.50,0:04:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,机械要用「处女血涂抹」\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mechanisms "must be anointed with the blood of virgins."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.77,0:04:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,差得远呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not even close.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.85,0:04:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好吧 我们继续查吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, then, I guess we keep lookin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.06,0:04:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 或是造假 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Or we fake it. - ‭Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.33,0:04:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,造假\N{\fnArial\fs30}We fake it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.52,0:04:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这一小时以来读过不下六个净化仪式了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I've read half a dozen purification rituals in the last hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.78,0:04:23.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以拿其中一个来净化我们的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we used one of those on … on our blood…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.18,0:04:25.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后呢 把它变成处子血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what? Revirginize it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.11,0:04:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.06,0:04:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们先净化血 然后施咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we purify the blood, then do the spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.60,0:04:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,两步混搭魔法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two-step, hybrid magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.12,0:04:46.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 第一步好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, that's step one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.90,0:04:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二步 该你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Step two, you're up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.58,0:04:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.37,0:04:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.62,0:05:02.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,起效了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's working.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.42,0:05:04.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,起效了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's working!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.79,0:05:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.57,0:05:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - ‭What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.84,0:05:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯奇 他料到我们会…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ketch! He knew we'd…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.81,0:05:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他肯定在地堡封锁机构上设置了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He must've put some kind of mystical dampener.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.21,0:05:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔法抑制器\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the bunker's lockdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.25,0:05:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔法不会起效的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Magic won't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.68,0:05:34.31,Note,0,0,0,0,,（第二天）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.45,0:05:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们试过了智取\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, we have… exhausted brains,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.58,0:05:39.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在试试蛮力吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I saw we try brawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.38,0:05:41.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么做 - 墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How? - ‭Walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.13,0:05:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,车库 瞭望台\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now the garage, the Crow's Nest,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.45,0:05:45.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这都是钢筋墙 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}these are all reinforced steel walls, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.19,0:05:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这里 只有混凝土\N{\fnArial\fs30}But right here, that's nothing but concrete.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.58,0:05:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里 是一条老下水管道\N{\fnArial\fs30}And right there, that's an old sewer pipe,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.40,0:05:53.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,直通地面 超控装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}goes straight up to the surface…to the override.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.96,0:05:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 那我们就…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So wait a second. We're just gonna…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.57,0:05:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,肖申克一把\N{\fnArial\fs30}Straight Shawshank this bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.64,0:06:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 戴护目镜 - 戴护目镜\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Goggles? - ‭Goggles.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.28,0:06:24.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}‭Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.84,0:06:31.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.14,0:06:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该休息了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We earned a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.30,0:06:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.51,0:06:39.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会打通的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.39,0:06:43.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. ‭
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.67,0:06:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,打不通的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.08,0:06:55.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们至少三天才能打到地面\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not gonna hit dirt for three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.32,0:06:57.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸运的话两天可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two if we're lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.70,0:07:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你感觉得到 空气很稀薄了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you feel it … the air, it's thin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.93,0:07:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且越来越稀薄\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's getting thinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.79,0:07:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.53,0:07:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}What part?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.99,0:07:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.07,0:07:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.20,0:07:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不久之前 我还觉得我们混得不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, it wasn't long ago, I thought we had it made.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.38,0:07:29.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们拯救了世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}We saved the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.74,0:07:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡回来了 妈妈回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got Cass back. We had Mom back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.86,0:07:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然不完美 但他们至少在身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it wasn't perfect, but still, we had 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.12,0:07:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,而现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.56,0:07:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在他们都走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now they're all gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.37,0:07:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 他们对她做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Mom, what they did to her…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.90,0:07:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被他们的推销蒙蔽了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just fell for their company line.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.64,0:07:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, I…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.68,0:08:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到了他们做的事 我想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw what they were doing, and I … and I thought,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.07,0:08:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,猎人达到那样的规模 那样的合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hunters on that scale, working together…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.60,0:08:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能做多少好事啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}how much good we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.38,0:08:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一加入\N{\fnArial\fs30}And once I was in, I…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.48,0:08:19.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,就开始盲从\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just followed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.57,0:08:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为那样简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause it was easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.51,0:08:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,更简单些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.18,0:08:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,比什么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easier than what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.46,0:08:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,比领导简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easier than leading.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.02,0:08:43.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想象的结局是这样的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this how you pictured it? The end?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.76,0:08:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道不是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you know it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.52,0:08:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直以为我们会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always thought we'd go out like…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.91,0:08:55.95,Title,0,0,0,0,,像《虎豹小霸王》那样英勇就义\N{\fnArial\fs30}Butch and Sundance style.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.23,0:08:57.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.97,0:09:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 荣耀光辉 - 荣耀光辉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Blaze of glory. - ‭Blaze of glory.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.10,0:09:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.05,0:09:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都是疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're lunatics.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.28,0:09:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这点子太蠢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a colossally stupid idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.93,0:09:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.59,0:09:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,又大 又美\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big, beautiful,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.62,0:09:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,又蠢\N{\fnArial\fs30}and dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.43,0:09:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这玩意放在我这儿好久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've had this thing for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.94,0:09:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直在等最合适的时机使用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Been waiting for the perfect moment to use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.83,0:09:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,爆炸可能害死我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}The explosion could kill us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.34,0:09:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能会把这整个地方震塌\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could bring the whole bloody place crashing down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.30,0:09:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是啊 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - ‭Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.69,0:09:31.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're lunatics.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.18,0:09:35.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,喜欢动作片 爱吃芝士汉堡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Action movie-loving, cheeseburger-eating,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.93,0:09:38.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,愚蠢的美国疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}moronic American lunatics.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.59,0:09:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 美人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.33,0:09:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你妈蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yippee ki-yay, mother …
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.78,0:10:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.18,0:10:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.01,0:10:29.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.30,0:11:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, lunatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.86,0:11:22.92,Note,0,0,0,0,,（南达科他州 苏福尔斯 治安官）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.31,0:11:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 玛丽 - 乔迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mary? - ‭Hey, Jody.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.76,0:11:35.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,有空吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a sec?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.93,0:11:41.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.57,0:11:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,没电\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.00,0:11:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,没电\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.06,0:11:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, I got one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.75,0:11:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Garth?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.42,0:11:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐 听到你的声音太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man. It's good to hear your voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.57,0:12:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我之前跟你说的英国人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, uh, those Brits I told you about,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.91,0:12:02.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在猎杀美国猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}they've got a hit out on American Hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.20,0:12:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜对于狼人猎人更是如此了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm guessing that goes double for werewolf hunters, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.32,0:12:07.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我没时间解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I don't have time to explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.49,0:12:09.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和贝丝得找个安全的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and Bess need to get someplace safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.78,0:12:12.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.48,0:12:15.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jody.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.44,0:12:25.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jody?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.05,0:12:30.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔迪 艾莉克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jody. Alex.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.75,0:12:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.72,0:12:40.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.13,0:12:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,她突然袭击我时 我以为她是恶魔呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}When she clocked me out of the blue, I thought she was a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.96,0:12:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,真没想到洗脑能这么彻底\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had no idea that brainwashing could be so thorough.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.83,0:12:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔迪 她…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jody, she…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.32,0:12:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,真对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.75,0:12:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不怪你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.62,0:12:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸好 艾莉克斯回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fortunately, Alex came home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.12,0:12:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不过是替你争取了时间 是你击昏了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I did was buy you time. You knocked her out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.77,0:13:03.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去给你找点止痛的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}‭I'll get you something for the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.21,0:13:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,来双份吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make it a double.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.61,0:13:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想扮我儿子的妈妈吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna play mother to my son?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.98,0:13:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他都归你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's all yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.02,0:13:21.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.81,0:13:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是你妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's not your mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.53,0:13:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.92,0:13:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你所认识的玛丽太不一样了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I too different from the Mary you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.67,0:13:33.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是太一样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or too much the same?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.66,0:13:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,她来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.50,0:13:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,做你该做的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do your thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.62,0:13:41.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你说你能治好她 治好她吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, you said you could fix her, so fix her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.15,0:13:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.80,0:13:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我… - 她撒谎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, I - ‭She lied.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.74,0:13:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.87,0:13:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽的洗脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary's programming…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.19,0:13:51.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不可逆的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's permanent.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.24,0:13:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you said…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.17,0:13:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们当时要杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were going to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.75,0:14:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们所认识的玛丽 好玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Mary that you know, the good Mary,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.69,0:14:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,她躲在不可穿透的心墙后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}she's hiding behind impenetrable psychic walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.76,0:14:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕这种墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm afraid these walls…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.79,0:14:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,是手榴弹打不倒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they can't be torn down with grenades.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.01,0:14:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈妈救不回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mother can't be saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.63,0:14:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 「夫人」 时候到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, "Lady, " time's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.74,0:14:28.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们留你一命只有一个原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}We only kept you alive for one reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.47,0:14:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.40,0:14:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个 凯奇一直在给妈妈打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, uh, Ketch keeps callin' Mom's phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.22,0:14:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我接吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.79,0:14:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,让它接进语音信箱就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let it go to voicemail.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.09,0:14:41.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去后院溜达溜达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's take a nice little short walk to the backyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.50,0:14:43.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不会停下的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not going to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.66,0:14:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快 他们会发现你们还活着 到时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon enough, they'll find out you're alive, and then…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.43,0:14:50.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果想听我的建议 逃跑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if you want my advice … run.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.88,0:14:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会跑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not running.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.63,0:14:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你就会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then, you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.61,0:14:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.61,0:14:58.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.13,0:15:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们抵抗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or we fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.92,0:15:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,脚从桌上拿下来 杰瑞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feet off the table, Jerry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.99,0:15:08.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.91,0:15:12.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下应该都到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That should be the last one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.40,0:15:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃尔特 罗伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walt. Roy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.62,0:15:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.73,0:15:26.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们好久没见你们了 自从\N{\fnArial\fs30}We haven't seen you guys since …
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.92,0:15:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从你们杀了我们 不介意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since you killed us. No hard feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.39,0:15:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐吧 自便\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, uh, please, get comfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.78,0:15:37.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.78,0:15:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不要说说叫我们来干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna tell us what we're doing here or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.90,0:15:44.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}‭Of course. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.89,0:15:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和我哥哥 我们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, so my … my brother and I, we … we, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.59,0:15:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 告诉你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.94,0:15:59.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我叫你们来的 因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I called you here because people…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.21,0:16:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的人在遭到屠杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}our people, are being slaughtered.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.51,0:16:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来就是我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're next.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.78,0:16:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,英国记录者 他们来到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The British Men of Letters, they came here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.21,0:16:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他们认为他们能比我们更好地做我们的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}because they thought they could do our job better than we could.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.48,0:16:16.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们用他们酷炫的装备和科技诱骗了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they hooked us with their flashy gear and their tech.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.09,0:16:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们大都明智地拒绝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most of you had the good sense to turn 'em down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.92,0:16:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.04,0:16:27.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说他们跟我们的目标一致\N{\fnArial\fs30}They said they wanted the same thing we wanted, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.50,0:16:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个没有怪物的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}A world free of monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.24,0:16:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那不是真话\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not what they really wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.36,0:16:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们想要控制权\N{\fnArial\fs30}They want control.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.51,0:16:35.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们想要的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}They want to live in a world.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.73,0:16:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他们可以坐在一个办公室里\N{\fnArial\fs30}where they can sit in some office.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.03,0:16:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,决定谁可以生 谁得去死\N{\fnArial\fs30}and decide who gets to live and who gets to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.40,0:16:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们杀了人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they've killed people.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.60,0:16:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们杀了无辜者\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've killed innocent people.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.92,0:16:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,就因为他们碍了事\N{\fnArial\fs30}just because they got in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.79,0:16:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们认为为目的可以不择手段\N{\fnArial\fs30}They think the ends justify the means.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.30,0:16:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们知道不是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we know better.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.51,0:16:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道猎魔并不仅仅是杀戮\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know hunting isn't just about killing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.43,0:16:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是做正确的事 哪怕这样很艰难\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about doing what's right, even when it's hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.45,0:16:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们听从直觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we go by our gut, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.87,0:17:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们按自己的规则来 这让他们害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}We play by our own rules, and that scares them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.41,0:17:03.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是他们要我们死的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why they want us dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.42,0:17:05.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们是他们唯一控制不了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause we're the one thing they can't control.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.76,0:17:07.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要我们做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what do you want from us?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.17,0:17:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你们跟随我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.97,0:17:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,打到他们家门口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take the fight to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.99,0:17:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他们出击前 干掉他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}To hit them before they hit us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.94,0:17:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们迅猛出击 不遗余力\N{\fnArial\fs30}We go in fast and hard and we fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.29,0:17:23.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他们打到趴\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we beat them down until they give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.88,0:17:26.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,或死\N{\fnArial\fs30}or until they're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.33,0:17:31.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都训练有素 武器精良\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, they're well-trained and well-armed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.69,0:17:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有些人可能会牺牲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some of us might not make it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.06,0:17:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们会赢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we will win.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.87,0:17:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会击败坏人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will take down the bad guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.30,0:17:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这是我们的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}because that's what we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.69,0:17:47.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们怕我们 嗯 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're scared of us. Yeah. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.00,0:17:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就该怕我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.41,0:18:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 知道该去哪吗 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}- You know where we're goin'? - Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.76,0:18:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好 10分钟后出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}‭Gear up. We roll out in 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.51,0:18:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.16,0:18:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 我不去 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, no. I'm not goin'. - ‭What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.02,0:18:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我腿伤成这样 我打不了仗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, my leg busted up the way it is, I'm no good in a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.25,0:18:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不论何时 受伤的迪恩·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I'll take a jacked up Dean Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.63,0:18:20.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,也胜过任何10个猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}over any 10 other Hunters any day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.31,0:18:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.07,0:18:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚刚看到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.88,0:18:25.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're ready for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.39,0:18:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去让那些混蛋知道谁是老大\N{\fnArial\fs30}You show those sons of bitches who's boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.53,0:18:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你呢 你要做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you? What are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.86,0:18:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要救妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna save Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.69,0:18:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果她还在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, if she's in there,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.60,0:18:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们真正的妈妈还在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}if our real Mom is in there somewhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.38,0:18:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我就要努力找到她 带她回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}then I'm gonna try and find her, bring her back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.92,0:18:57.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 唐娜 - 在一栋安全屋等着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, Donna's - ‭Waiting for me at a safe house.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.02,0:18:58.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要直接开过去 路上不能停\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should drive straight there, no stops.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.66,0:19:00.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一切结束 你会给我打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you'll call me when this is all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.91,0:19:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.01,0:19:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 乔迪 - 我会小心 我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And, Jody - I'll be careful. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.69,0:19:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是想说这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not what I was gonna ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.92,0:19:10.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,狠狠收拾他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kick it in the ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.64,0:19:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你行的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.13,0:19:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.14,0:19:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.76,0:19:28.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}Promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.38,0:19:31.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,臭小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.01,0:19:34.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 混蛋 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jerk. - ‭Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.27,0:19:46.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 你进入过我妈妈的脑袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, you got inside my Mom's head once before.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.73,0:19:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我呢 能让我进去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about me? You get me in?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.59,0:19:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You? I…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.59,0:19:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.42,0:19:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我需要我的设备\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I need my rig.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.62,0:19:56.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在哪 - 在基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where is it? - ‭At the base.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.74,0:20:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果材料合适\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I suppose with the right materials,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.44,0:20:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以自己拼凑一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could cobble something together.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.57,0:20:08.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标名单很快就发下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Target lists will be distributed shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.01,0:20:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,在第二阶段中\N{\fnArial\fs30}In Phase Two,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.65,0:20:13.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,百无禁忌\N{\fnArial\fs30}there are no restrictions.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.90,0:20:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,家庭成员 路人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Family members, bystanders.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.61,0:20:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要留下活口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't…leave…witnesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.70,0:20:21.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That will be all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.39,0:20:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,佩吉 查一下我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paige, I need you to pull up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.16,0:20:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,一位人员的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}the location of one of our assets,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.88,0:20:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且不要告诉别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I need you to keep it between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.91,0:20:43.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁 - 玛丽·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who? - ‭Mary Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.68,0:20:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's in…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.76,0:20:49.72,Note,0,0,0,0,,（玛丽·温彻斯特）
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.95,0:20:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,堪萨斯州 黎巴嫩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lebanon, Kansas.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.05,0:21:06.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 你需要的东西在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, where's the stuff you need?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.44,0:21:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该在仓库里 地牢旁边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should be in storage, next to the dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.42,0:21:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我会让你溜出我的视线吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think I'm lettin' you out of my sight?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.75,0:21:15.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要我提醒你 我的组织留下我等死吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Need I remind you that my organization left me to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.64,0:21:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 我只站在我自己这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}At this point, I'm not on anyone's side but my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.30,0:21:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 我会帮你救你妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I help you try to save your mother,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.56,0:21:25.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,等尘埃落定\N{\fnArial\fs30}and when the dust clears…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.60,0:21:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 我放了你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? I let you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.77,0:21:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想再次见到我儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to see my son again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.29,0:21:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是叫你饶过我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not asking for a pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.21,0:21:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只求让我先跑一会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm asking for a head start.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.86,0:22:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些电极让你的δ波与玛丽同步\N{\fnArial\fs30}These electrodes sync your Delta waves with Mary's.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.39,0:22:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,形成精神连接\N{\fnArial\fs30}forming a psychic link.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.27,0:22:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,但要进入她的心智\N{\fnArial\fs30}But to enter her psyche.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.16,0:22:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,会需要一定的专注和技艺\N{\fnArial\fs30}will take a certain measure of concentration and skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.00,0:22:17.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,由于没时间教你如何达到\N{\fnArial\fs30}And as there's no time to teach you how to reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.75,0:22:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须的治疗梦境\N{\fnArial\fs30}the necessary therapeutic dreamstate,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.48,0:22:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要依靠这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm banking on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.81,0:22:27.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,混有强效镇定剂的催眠剂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hypnotic agents laced with a potent sedative.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.76,0:22:35.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,足以放倒一头大象了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's enough to knock an elephant on its trunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.07,0:22:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.03,0:22:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,保险措施 你能理解吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little insurance. You understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.15,0:22:49.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会疼的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This will hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.14,0:22:51.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能理解吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.71,0:24:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.37,0:24:32.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你醒了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.26,0:24:34.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,睡得香吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's the nap?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.65,0:24:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 午餐好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, lunch is ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.80,0:24:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.98,0:25:02.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得出去了 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta get out of here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.60,0:25:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.13,0:25:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.33,0:25:10.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.37,0:25:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.77,0:25:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}What is happening out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.20,0:25:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,外围被突破\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perimeter's breached.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.25,0:25:54.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.04,0:25:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.27,0:25:57.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士们\N{\fnArial\fs30}ladies,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.81,0:25:59.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们知道该怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.58,0:26:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.39,0:26:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道他们扰乱了你的心智\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I know that they messed with your head, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.45,0:26:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it feels.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.79,0:26:18.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里感觉更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}better in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.94,0:26:21.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,更安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}It feels safer.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.54,0:26:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我需要你听到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I-I need you to hear me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.92,0:26:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在想 或许我们稍后该带萨姆去公园\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was thinking maybe we should take Sammy to the park later,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.96,0:26:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,在爸爸回家之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}before Daddy gets home.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.56,0:26:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sound good?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.72,0:26:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom, look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.37,0:26:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're choosing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.54,0:26:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最喜欢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.80,0:26:45.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.76,0:26:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你吃完的\N{\fnArial\fs30}After you eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.90,0:26:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想给你最好的 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only want good things for you, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.06,0:27:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我绝不会让你有事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll never let anything bad happen to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.58,0:27:09.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恨你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.58,0:27:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,上上上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go, go, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.87,0:27:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,上 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Hurry! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.94,0:28:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你骗了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lied to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.76,0:28:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我那时还小\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.98,0:28:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你答应会保护我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You promised you'd keep me safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.91,0:28:34.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后却跟亚撒色做了协议\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then you make a deal with Azazel.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.65,0:28:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 那救了爸爸一命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it saved Dad's life,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.18,0:28:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我告诉你发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'll tell you something else that happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.24,0:28:43.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,1983年11月2日\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because on November 2, 1983,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.67,0:28:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,黄眼恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}old Yellow Eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.62,0:28:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,走进了萨姆的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}came waltzing in to Sammy's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.75,0:28:50.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,就因为你们的协议\N{\fnArial\fs30}because of your deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.32,0:28:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你抛下了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You left us.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.22,0:29:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们孤独无助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alone. ‭
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.00,0:29:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为爸爸已是行尸走肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause Dad was just a shell.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.58,0:29:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的完美妻子 死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}His perfect wife? Gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.21,0:29:15.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们完美的妈妈 这完美的家庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our perfect Mom, the perfect family…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.03,0:29:18.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,都没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}was gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.86,0:29:20.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.69,0:29:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to be…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.19,0:29:28.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,担起哥哥以外的职责\N{\fnArial\fs30}more than just a brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.09,0:29:29.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要当爹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to be a father.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.87,0:29:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,又当娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I had to be a mother,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.54,0:29:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好保护他\N{\fnArial\fs30}to keep him safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.71,0:29:39.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不公平\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that wasn't fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.84,0:29:43.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I couldn't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.81,0:29:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想知道那是什么样子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you wanna know what that was like?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.75,0:29:54.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们杀了他爱的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They killed the girl that he loved.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.89,0:30:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他被路西法附身了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He got possessed by Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.46,0:30:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在地狱里折磨他\N{\fnArial\fs30}They tortured him in Hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.54,0:30:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他失去了灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he lost his soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.38,0:30:12.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}His soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.00,0:30:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,都因为你\N{\fnArial\fs30}All because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.39,0:30:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一切都是因为你\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of it was because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.68,0:30:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恨你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.77,0:30:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恨你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.97,0:30:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.33,0:31:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我 忍不住\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause I can't … I can't help it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.46,0:31:15.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're my Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.58,0:31:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I understand…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.32,0:31:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我也曾为了我所爱的人做协议\N{\fnArial\fs30}…'cause I have made deals to save the ones I love.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.63,0:31:31.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不止一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}more than once.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.29,0:31:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我原谅你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I forgive you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.04,0:31:43.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我原谅你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I forgive you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.53,0:31:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我原谅一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}For all of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.95,0:31:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.46,0:31:56.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,在另一边\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the other side of this,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.56,0:32:00.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以重新开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can start over.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.64,0:32:01.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.71,0:32:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 我 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, me, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.83,0:32:07.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这次可以好好来过\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can get it right this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.04,0:32:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我需要你抵抗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I need you to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.77,0:32:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 我需要你抵抗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now, I need you to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.37,0:32:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你 我需要你看我 妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you … I need you to look at me, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.05,0:32:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你好好看我 看到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to really look at me and see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.58,0:32:24.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 我需要你看到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Mom, I need you to see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.07,0:32:29.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.38,0:32:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.76,0:32:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.48,0:33:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - ‭Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.14,0:33:35.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 以为能找回你妈妈吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Thought you'd get your Mum back?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.32,0:33:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 迪恩 结局不是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, Dean. Not how this ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.15,0:33:41.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,结局是我了结你\N{\fnArial\fs30}This ends with me ending you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.82,0:33:44.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna kill you. ‭
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.50,0:33:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}‭You won't,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.85,0:33:49.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我会很喜欢看你尝试\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'd very much enjoy it if you tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.89,0:34:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道你妈妈怎么说你吗 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to know what your mother said about you, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.86,0:34:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们那些\N{\fnArial\fs30}All those.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.06,0:34:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,在路上猎魔的漫漫长日\N{\fnArial\fs30}long days and even longer nights.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.11,0:34:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,和更加漫长的夜晚里\N{\fnArial\fs30}out on the road, hunting?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.16,0:34:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都没说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absolutely nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.76,0:34:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真好玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.76,0:34:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让我来 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I got this. - ‭Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.82,0:35:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把我们丢在地堡里时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you left us alone in the bunker,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.70,0:35:12.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早知道你是疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}man, I knew you were psycho,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.89,0:35:14.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我没想到你那么蠢\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I didn't think you were stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.04,0:35:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有很多特点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I may be many things…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.88,0:35:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不蠢\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but I'm not stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.94,0:35:45.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.17,0:35:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}‭Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.57,0:36:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道你是个杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew you were a killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.42,0:36:13.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You both are.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.84,0:36:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.10,0:36:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不惜代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever it takes …
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.45,0:36:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,开启一个传送门 让我离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}open a portal. Just get me the hell out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.52,0:36:35.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕我们现在没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid we don't have the resources.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.53,0:36:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,进行撤离的资源\N{\fnArial\fs30}for an extraction at this moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.18,0:36:42.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,别 别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't! Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.15,0:36:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, Dean …
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.64,0:36:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.51,0:36:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是海斯吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you must be Hess, I trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.30,0:36:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是这里的负责人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're in charge of this whole operation?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.02,0:36:57.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者说 这个烂摊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or, uh, what's left of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.69,0:36:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.03,0:37:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你或许认为杀我对你最有利\N{\fnArial\fs30}you might think it in your best interest to kill me,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.57,0:37:04.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,结束这里的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}to end all of this here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.66,0:37:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你现在杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But shooting me now,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.14,0:37:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,切断跟英国记录者的一切联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}severing all ties with the British Men of Letters,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.78,0:37:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这样的时刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}at this particular moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.44,0:37:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,只会是天大的错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}that would be a grievous mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.23,0:37:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我深表怀疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I doubt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.88,0:37:16.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有重新考虑的理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are reasons to reconsider.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.20,0:37:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有些事不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things that you don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.21,0:37:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are these?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.93,0:37:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,路西法回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer is back.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.05,0:37:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.55,0:37:45.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,都因为你的好朋友 克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}All thanks to your good friend Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.71,0:37:48.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然对他也没什么好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not that it did him much good.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.49,0:37:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.98,0:37:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the Devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.42,0:37:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,去找他儿子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}is out looking for his son,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.55,0:37:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟随它母亲的脚步\N{\fnArial\fs30}following in its mother's footsteps,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.50,0:38:03.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,追踪她和你的天使朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}tracking her and your friend the angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.51,0:38:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果路西法找到了那个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Lucifer gets his hands on that child,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.60,0:38:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会不可阻挡\N{\fnArial\fs30}they'll be unstoppable.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.65,0:38:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能单独去面对 你需要我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't face that alone. You need us.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.91,0:38:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,听她的 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to her, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.72,0:38:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,免了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.10,0:38:43.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.93,0:39:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到些\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Found some.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.71,0:39:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,过期的止痛药\N{\fnArial\fs30}expired prescription painkillers, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.39,0:39:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,真幸运\N{\fnArial\fs30}lucky me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.89,0:39:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 你不用做那个 那不是你的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom, you don't have to do that. It's not your job.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.21,0:39:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这\N{\fnArial\fs30}‭This…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.92,0:39:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.74,0:39:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是因为我\N{\fnArial\fs30}is because of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.53,0:39:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会有事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.98,0:39:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,有事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.21,0:39:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从我回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since I've been back,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.06,0:40:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我一直很疏离\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know… I've been distant.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.97,0:40:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至冷漠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cold, even.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.36,0:40:08.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leaving you,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.90,0:40:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟他们合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}working with them…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.45,0:40:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是想做弥补\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was trying to make things right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.19,0:40:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是是远远地弥补 因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just from a distance, because…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.38,0:40:25.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你们在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}being here with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.01,0:40:28.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,实在太难\N{\fnArial\fs30}was too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.46,0:40:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到我对你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seeing what I'd done.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.62,0:40:33.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,对萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.44,0:40:36.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,造成的伤害 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and to Sam, I…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.46,0:40:38.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 你做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom, what you did,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.87,0:40:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个协议\N{\fnArial\fs30}the deal…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.20,0:40:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}…everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.10,0:40:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,此后发生的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's happened since.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.67,0:40:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,都塑造了如今的我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}has made us who we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.03,0:40:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是什么人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And who we are?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.74,0:40:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}We kick ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.22,0:40:58.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们拯救世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}We save the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.19,0:41:04.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.05,0:41:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm scared. What…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.92,0:41:13.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他不能原谅我呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if he can't forgive me?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.45,0:41:18.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.55,0:41:22.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不用怕我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to be scared of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.09,0:41:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你回来太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glad you're back, man.
